        "inference": "To verify compliance with this right and assess the impact of the fraud model, the Bureau should require NOC to produce records of human review of those automated decisions."
      },
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "UAE-PDPL#0047",
          "quote": "c. Decisions made based on automated processing, including profiling."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

